{"id":"vod_md_5657","vodId":"5657","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"我的英雄学院第二季","name_cn":"我的英雄学院第二季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231012-1/c7c9932e02081924716a858d51bc9e6e.jpg"},"summary":"因偶然事件为契机与世界第一的英雄欧尔麦特相遇的“无个性”少年绿谷出久，身体内继承了欧尔麦特的个性，具有了成为英雄的资质。在经过严厉的训练后，绿谷出久成功进入了雄英高中入学，在与爆豪胜己、丽日御茶子等英雄科1年A班的同学们一起在互相切磋和学习中度过每一天。在这种情况下，全国瞩目的活动“雄英高中体育祭”来临了。目指第一的爆豪胜己，因为家族原因具有强烈意志的饭田天哉，为了否定父亲而渴求胜利的轰焦冻，以及英雄科1年B班的成员...。雄英高中所有同学都气志高涨，绿谷出久也重新下定了决心。“我也会全力去比赛的！“以最顶级的英雄为目标的学生们，“个性”、力量和自尊的战斗拉开了序幕！！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-12 08:42:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/0RFjMWAB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/5ZXLxRO6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/vVfUaWxa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/yEdSa5b8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/fbGboyie/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/uID8npwv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/9onj8fY5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/T1PVDKCS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/LUeX3Sns/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/gg1g3PVV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/7NhGzBKC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/KJuoH29T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/RoFTQhK8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/3z6m66db/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231005/oQiBLPw0/index.m3u8"}